<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥά̆φᾰν-ος</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Att.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράμβη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cabbage, Brassica cretica</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				109
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶδ᾽ ὅτι καλοῦμεν ῥάφανον, ὑμεῖς δ᾽
					οἱ ξένοι κράμβην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
				</span></i>
			 Car.<i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ῥ., ἣν καλοῦσί τινες κράμβην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					551a15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.6.6
			</span></i>, al.; it was boiled for use, <i><span class="en">
				Nicoch.
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				286
			</span></i>; distd. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίς</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἀγρία</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράμβη ἀγρία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.6.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαφανὶς ἀγρία</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.15.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			<i>tuberous spurge, Euphorbia Apios</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.175
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ὀρεία, ὀρεινή</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.12.1
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.175
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> also,=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαφανίς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				924a34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				79.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.247
			</span></i>. (
				Ion.
			(?) and late Gr. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέφανος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.115
			</span></i>, <u>Gloss.</u>: 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάπυς</span>
			.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
